{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12908","headline":"奉送王相公缙赴幽州巡边 · 韩翃","name":"奉送王相公缙赴幽州巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄阁开帷幄，丹墀侍冕旒。\n位高汤左相，权总汉诸侯。\n不改周南化，仍分赵北忧。\n双旌过易水，千骑入幽州。\n塞草连天暮，边风动地秋。\n无因随远道，结束佩吴钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12908.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12908","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}